            "review_text": "Carman_Wong\nHong Kong, China5 contributions\n0\nExpensive price, poor food!\nNov 2018 • Family\nWe arrive the hotel at night and rush to the restaurant nearby the hotel to have dinner. The restaurant is clean. The waiter's and the waitress's manner is polite. But the food is very expensive. The waiter told us that the tiger prawn is 1kg for 600,000 VND. Afterward, we know that we can have a very decent buffet even in high class hotel with this price. As a result, we only got a dishes of fried little shrimp on the table and it is not fresh!\nI will not recommend this restaurant to anyone.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 5, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
